{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tB0rnN5fS01794382756.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>輝達行政總裁黃仁勳承認有婚外情，亦引起有關晶片出口等爭議，國台辦發言人回應相關提問時，指外交部已作出回應，強調兩岸產業鏈供應鏈保持穩定強韌是現實需求。</p><p></p><p>國台辦發言人張晗說：「對於相關信息有關部門已經作出回應。我要強調的是兩岸產業交流合作，兩岸企業攜手發展，符合市場經濟規律，符合兩岸企業利益。包括半導體在內兩岸產業鏈供應鏈保持穩定強韌，既是客觀事實，也是現實需求。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:35:00.343780+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T12:51:40.299207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:25.336904+00:00","content_hash":"84befe91773d48c46733e1c2189ced3e6f03a3316db865ffa55016c5115dc67c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:35:00.343780+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}